    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Please separate the `add` and `later` functions from `mini.deps` and name it `mini.lazyload`.\r\n\r\nDevelopment of `mini.deps` has [frozen thanks to `vim.pack`](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-deps.md#development-freeze).\r\n\r\nHowever, vanilla nvim cannot lazy load as easily as MiniDeps.add/later, so I still need those.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Please separate the <code class=\"notranslate\">add</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">later</code> functions from <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.deps</code> and name it <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.lazyload</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Development of <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.deps</code> has <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-deps.md#development-freeze\">frozen thanks to <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.pack</code></a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">However, vanilla nvim cannot lazy load as easily as MiniDeps.add/later, so I still need those.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Please separate the add and later functions from mini.deps and name it mini.lazyload.\nDevelopment of mini.deps has frozen thanks to vim.pack.\nHowever, vanilla nvim cannot lazy load as easily as MiniDeps.add/later, so I still need those.",
