            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There is already an alternative to `now()` and `later()` in the form of `MiniMisc.safely()` (i.e. in 'mini.misc' module). Here is the quote *from the link you provided*:\r\n\r\n> ... and `:h MiniMisc.safely()` as `MiniDeps.now()` and `MiniDeps.later()` alternative. See https://echasnovski.com/vim-pack-guide for more details, including recommendations about migration from 'mini.deps'.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">There is already an alternative to <code class=\"notranslate\">now()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">later()</code> in the form of <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniMisc.safely()</code> (i.e. in 'mini.misc' module). Here is the quote <em>from the link you provided</em>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">... and <code class=\"notranslate\">:h MiniMisc.safely()</code> as <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniDeps.now()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniDeps.later()</code> alternative. See <a href=\"https://echasnovski.com/vim-pack-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://echasnovski.com/vim-pack-guide</a> for more details, including recommendations about migration from 'mini.deps'.</p>\n</blockquote>",
            "bodyText": "There is already an alternative to now() and later() in the form of MiniMisc.safely() (i.e. in 'mini.misc' module). Here is the quote from the link you provided:\n\n... and :h MiniMisc.safely() as MiniDeps.now() and MiniDeps.later() alternative. See https://echasnovski.com/vim-pack-guide for more details, including recommendations about migration from 'mini.deps'.",
